00:10:59.935 --> 00:11:01.055
Sana hindi ka natakot.

00:11:01.616 --> 00:11:02.976
Salamat sa iyong tulong.

00:11:03.096 --> 00:11:04.895
Ako si Kong Hou mula sa Yunhua Sect's

00:11:05.016 --> 00:11:05.695
Qiyue Peak.

00:11:06.016 --> 00:11:06.976
Lady Kong Hou

00:11:07.096 --> 00:11:08.096
mula sa Yunhua Sect.

00:11:08.216 --> 00:11:08.935
Ikinagagalak kitang makilala.

00:11:09.055 --> 00:11:10.016
Hindi na kailangan ng mga pormalidad.

00:11:10.096 --> 00:11:11.295
Simula nung nagkatagpo kami

00:11:11.415 --> 00:11:12.616
ang mga maitim na magsasaka,

00:11:12.736 --> 00:11:13.695
kinailangan naming kumilos.

00:11:13.815 --> 00:11:14.815
Pinagtagpo tayo ng tadhana.

00:11:14.935 --> 00:11:16.136
Bakit hindi ka pumunta at manatili

00:11:16.136 --> 00:11:16.895
sa Yuanji Sect

00:11:17.016 --> 00:11:17.856
sa loob ng ilang araw?

00:11:18.136 --> 00:11:19.655
Hindi, ayos lang.

00:11:20.695 --> 00:11:21.415
binibini.

00:11:21.535 --> 00:11:22.496
- Ako at ang aking mga kaibigan
- Binibini.

00:11:22.616 --> 00:11:23.415
may mga dapat gawin.

00:11:23.575 --> 00:11:24.415
Kailangan na nating pumunta.

00:11:24.535 --> 00:11:25.535
Tama ba, Huan Zong?

00:11:25.535 --> 00:11:26.256
Walang pagmamadali.

00:11:27.376 --> 00:11:28.935
Hindi ba lagi mong gusto

00:11:29.016 --> 00:11:30.775
para maglaro ng phoenix-headed konghou?

00:11:31.376 --> 00:11:33.415
Ang babaeng ito dito
ay isang music cultivator din.

00:11:35.136 --> 00:11:35.895
Paano ito?

00:11:36.336 --> 00:11:37.976
Humingi ng patnubay sa kanya.

00:11:38.256 --> 00:11:38.815
Sige na.

00:11:43.096 --> 00:11:44.256
Ang aking nakababatang kapatid na si Jin Ling

00:11:44.336 --> 00:11:45.055
ay isang kilala

00:11:45.175 --> 00:11:46.256
tagapag-aral ng musika.

00:11:46.415 --> 00:11:47.216
bakit ayaw mo

00:11:47.216 --> 00:11:48.376
makipag-usap sa isa't isa?

00:11:48.695 --> 00:11:49.496
Jin Ling?

00:11:49.575 --> 00:11:50.376
Kaya ikaw ang ika-11

00:11:50.376 --> 00:11:51.256
musical cultivator

00:11:51.256 --> 00:11:52.295
sa Lingyou Realm.

00:11:52.295 --> 00:11:53.415
tama yan.

00:11:55.616 --> 00:11:57.175
Hindi ka man lang makapaglaro

00:11:57.175 --> 00:11:58.055
iyong natal weapon?

00:12:01.456 --> 00:12:03.055
Hindi naman ganun.

00:12:03.256 --> 00:12:05.096
Hindi pa lang ako sanay.

00:12:05.256 --> 00:12:06.496
Mapapabuti ito sa pagsasanay.

00:12:06.655 --> 00:12:07.175
Since

00:12:07.175 --> 00:12:08.415
binibisita ko ang iyong sekta,

00:12:08.575 --> 00:12:09.815
Hihilingin ko ang iyong gabay.

00:12:09.976 --> 00:12:11.136
Tara, alis na tayo.

00:12:11.256 --> 00:12:12.136
binibini.

00:12:12.295 --> 00:12:13.895
Ganito ang sekta namin.

00:12:17.775 --> 00:12:18.415
sa ganitong paraan?

00:12:18.415 --> 00:12:19.055
Pagkatapos mo.

00:12:19.055 --> 00:12:19.935
Sige.

00:12:21.336 --> 00:12:22.456
Zhou Xiao.

00:12:26.376 --> 00:12:28.256
Kami ay mga disipulo ng Liuguang Sect.

00:12:28.736 --> 00:12:30.136
Bisitahin din natin

00:12:30.415 --> 00:12:31.535
ang iyong iginagalang na sekta?

00:12:33.295 --> 00:12:34.815
(Paano kung makialam sila...)

00:12:34.935 --> 00:12:36.175
(Pero hindi ko kayang masaktan)

00:12:36.336 --> 00:12:37.736
(ang Liuguang Sect.)

00:12:38.736 --> 00:12:40.376
Mga alagad ng Liuguang Sect

00:12:40.376 --> 00:12:41.415
ay higit sa maligayang pagdating.

00:12:41.575 --> 00:12:42.976
Sa ganitong paraan.

00:12:43.415 --> 00:12:44.256
salamat po.

00:12:44.496 --> 00:12:45.216
Pakiusap.

00:12:46.895 --> 00:12:47.815
Nakakapagod na paglalakbay, ha?

00:12:47.935 --> 00:12:49.016
Hindi naman.

00:12:49.575 --> 00:12:51.136
Mayroon kaming magagandang tanawin.

00:12:51.295 --> 00:12:52.016
gagawin ko talaga

00:12:52.016 --> 00:12:52.775
ipakita sa iyo sa paligid.

00:12:52.775 --> 00:12:53.336
Sige.

00:12:56.775 --> 00:12:58.535
Jin Ling, ano iyon?

00:12:58.535 --> 00:12:59.575
namiss ko.

00:13:02.216 --> 00:13:02.976
Hindi mo ba mahanap

00:13:02.976 --> 00:13:03.815
ang mga maitim na magsasaka

00:13:03.815 --> 00:13:05.096
medyo kakaiba?

00:13:05.496 --> 00:13:06.736
Una ang mga dark cultivator.

00:13:07.055 --> 00:13:08.256
Tapos itong mga lalaki.

00:13:08.575 --> 00:13:09.856
Sa tingin mo ba magkarelasyon sila

00:13:09.895 --> 00:13:11.136
sa mga dark cultivator?

00:13:12.535 --> 00:13:13.535
Ito ay kahina-hinala.

00:13:15.695 --> 00:13:16.376
Tingnan mo.

00:13:16.655 --> 00:13:18.655
Ang bulaklak na ito ay nagdadala ng madilim na enerhiya.

00:13:21.136 --> 00:13:22.575
Bakit may mga masasamang bagay

00:13:22.575 --> 00:13:23.895
malapit sa Yuanji Sect?

00:13:32.288 --> 00:13:34.720
(Sekta ng Yuanji)

00:13:44.928 --> 00:13:46.784
(Master Shuang Qing,
Pinuno ng Yuanji Sect)

00:13:46.784 --> 00:13:49.632
(Zhang Feng, Anak ni Master Shuang Qing)

00:13:56.775 --> 00:13:57.535
Feng.

00:13:57.695 --> 00:13:59.856
Sa talino ng iyong ama,

00:14:00.815 --> 00:14:01.775
ang aming Yuanji Sect

00:14:01.895 --> 00:14:04.136
tiyak na magiging

00:14:04.175 --> 00:14:07.096
isa sa Sampung Dakilang Sekta ng Lingyou Realm.

00:14:09.136 --> 00:14:09.856
Ikaw...

00:14:10.295 --> 00:14:11.295
Ang iyong ama...

00:14:13.136 --> 00:14:14.055
alam ko

00:14:14.256 --> 00:14:15.655
nag-aalala ka rin

00:14:16.175 --> 00:14:16.976
na ang planong ito

00:14:16.976 --> 00:14:18.136
baka hindi gumana.

00:14:18.456 --> 00:14:19.535
Pero

00:14:20.256 --> 00:14:22.535
na walang kwentang Yunhua Sect

00:14:22.695 --> 00:14:24.055
nagpapanatili ng posisyon nito

00:14:24.055 --> 00:14:25.856
kabilang sa Sampung Dakilang Sekta.

00:14:26.136 --> 00:14:26.895
Bukod,

00:14:27.055 --> 00:14:28.256
Kong Hou

00:14:28.376 --> 00:14:29.695
maaaring talunan

00:14:29.695 --> 00:14:31.415
walang espirituwal na ugat,

00:14:32.136 --> 00:14:33.496
pero siya pa rin

00:14:33.695 --> 00:14:35.736
Ang pinahahalagahang alagad ni Wang Tong.

00:14:35.895 --> 00:14:38.175
Kung pwede natin siyang agawin

00:14:38.256 --> 00:14:39.815
at ipapakasal sa kanya si Xiao,

00:14:42.415 --> 00:14:43.935
gagawin ng Yunhua Sect

00:14:44.336 --> 00:14:46.256
kailangang tumulong sa pag-promote sa amin

00:14:46.415 --> 00:14:48.016
dahil sa ugnayan ng aming pamilya.

00:14:48.256 --> 00:14:49.295
agawin mo siya.

00:14:49.456 --> 00:14:50.535
agawin ang lahat.

00:14:50.695 --> 00:14:52.096
Oo, agawin mo siya.

00:14:54.295 --> 00:14:55.815
Halika, Feng.

00:14:57.096 --> 00:14:58.496
Hayaan akong magpaliwanag

00:14:58.496 --> 00:14:59.815
detalyado ang plano.

00:14:59.935 --> 00:15:03.055
Unang hakbang. Iniligtas ni Hero ang dalaga.

00:15:03.295 --> 00:15:04.976
Iniligtas ni Hero ang dalaga.

00:15:05.136 --> 00:15:06.336
Unang magtatag

00:15:06.336 --> 00:15:08.216
Zhou Xiao, ang aming punong disipulo,

00:15:08.216 --> 00:15:11.096
bilang isang mapangahas na bayani.

00:15:14.336 --> 00:15:15.216
Ikalawang hakbang.

00:15:15.336 --> 00:15:17.616
Matapos bumalik si Kong Hou kasama niya,

00:15:17.775 --> 00:15:20.376
papurihan ang lahat ng alagad

00:15:20.376 --> 00:15:22.136
buong araw

00:15:22.336 --> 00:15:24.456
para maging kahanga-hanga siya.

00:15:25.575 --> 00:15:26.815
Huwag isulat ito.

00:15:26.856 --> 00:15:28.695
Ang ikatlong hakbang ay ang pinakamahalaga.

00:15:30.616 --> 00:15:32.136
Isang mapagpasyang suntok.

00:15:32.216 --> 00:15:34.736
Ipapakasal kay Xiao si Kong Hou.

00:15:34.775 --> 00:15:37.616
Ang isang tapat na asawa
ay sumusunod sa pangunguna ng kanyang asawa.

00:15:37.775 --> 00:15:42.096
Siya ay magiging isa sa atin.

00:15:44.496 --> 00:15:46.096
Inayos ko na lahat.

00:15:46.175 --> 00:15:46.775
Sige.

00:15:49.256 --> 00:15:51.456
Pumila para salubungin ang punong alagad.

00:15:55.655 --> 00:15:56.295
ako...

00:15:57.695 --> 00:15:58.976
Masyado akong pinapahalagahan

00:15:59.096 --> 00:16:00.775
pumila at batiin siya

00:16:00.856 --> 00:16:01.376
sa tao.

00:16:02.336 --> 00:16:03.256
Xiao.

00:16:07.895 --> 00:16:08.736
Feng.

00:16:08.856 --> 00:16:10.096
Ilang beses ko nang sinabi sayo.

00:16:10.096 --> 00:16:12.456
Tingnan mo kung saan ka pupunta.

00:16:12.775 --> 00:16:14.695
Napakatigas ng noo.

00:16:15.376 --> 00:16:15.976
Sa ganitong paraan.

00:16:22.935 --> 00:16:25.376
Nakatayo si Senior Zhou Xiao na parang pine

00:16:25.376 --> 00:16:26.496
matayog sa itaas ng mga palumpong.

00:16:26.496 --> 00:16:28.935
Nakatayo si Senior Zhou Xiao na parang pine

00:16:28.935 --> 00:16:30.055
matayog sa itaas ng mga palumpong.

00:16:30.096 --> 00:16:32.535
Nakatayo si Senior Zhou Xiao na parang pine

00:16:32.535 --> 00:16:33.655
matayog sa itaas ng mga palumpong.

00:16:33.695 --> 00:16:34.256
ayos lang ako.

00:16:34.256 --> 00:16:36.336
Nakatayo si Senior Zhou Xiao na parang pine

00:16:36.336 --> 00:16:37.456
matayog sa itaas ng mga palumpong.

00:16:37.535 --> 00:16:39.976
Nakatayo si Senior Zhou Xiao na parang pine

00:16:39.976 --> 00:16:41.096
matayog sa itaas ng mga palumpong.

00:16:41.216 --> 00:16:42.456
Senior Zhou Xiao...

00:16:45.336 --> 00:16:46.096
Ito dito

00:16:46.256 --> 00:16:47.856
ay si Lady Kong Hou mula sa Yunhua Sect.

00:16:48.016 --> 00:16:50.535
Tinatanggap namin si Lady Kong Hou
ng Yunhua Sect.

00:16:50.695 --> 00:16:53.295
Tinatanggap namin si Lady Kong Hou
ng Yunhua Sect.

00:16:53.976 --> 00:16:55.136
Mga taong sekta mo

00:16:55.136 --> 00:16:56.456
siguradong mga seremonya ng pag-ibig.

00:16:56.456 --> 00:16:57.295
Ang punong alagad

00:16:57.376 --> 00:16:58.655
ang ating gabay na pigura.

00:16:58.815 --> 00:17:00.055
Tatayo sana ako sa gate

00:17:00.055 --> 00:17:01.655
para batiin siya araw-araw.

00:17:04.535 --> 00:17:06.216
Kailan ka magkakaroon ng oras

00:17:06.256 --> 00:17:07.335
para makipag-spar sa amin?

00:17:09.256 --> 00:17:10.256
Jin Ling.

00:17:10.375 --> 00:17:11.896
Sinabi sa amin ni Master na gawin ito.

00:17:12.055 --> 00:17:12.936
Huwag mo siyang patulan.

00:17:23.055 --> 00:17:24.696
Hindi ako binigo ni Xiao.

00:17:24.736 --> 00:17:27.095
Hindi ako binigo ni Xiao.

00:17:40.775 --> 00:17:41.456
Sino ito?

00:17:45.055 --> 00:17:45.736
Huan Zong.

00:17:46.016 --> 00:17:46.936
Sino siya?

00:17:47.855 --> 00:17:49.016
Itong mga taong sekta

00:17:49.016 --> 00:17:50.216
kakaiba talaga.

00:17:57.416 --> 00:17:58.496
Sino ang mga iyon

00:17:58.496 --> 00:17:59.736
mga kabataan?

00:18:01.055 --> 00:18:02.095
Ang isa ay tinatawag na Huan Zong,

00:18:02.256 --> 00:18:03.095
isa pang Lin Hu.

00:18:03.295 --> 00:18:04.496
Mga Alagad ng Liuguang Sect.

00:18:04.656 --> 00:18:06.416
Naglalakbay sila kasama si Kong Hou.

00:18:06.416 --> 00:18:06.936
(Liuguang Sect)
Hindi ko kaya

00:18:07.016 --> 00:18:08.095
talikuran sila

00:18:08.216 --> 00:18:09.696
at kinailangan silang i-host dito.

00:18:15.416 --> 00:18:16.976
Ito ay kakaiba.

00:18:19.016 --> 00:18:20.615
Mga alagad ng Liuguang Sect

00:18:20.615 --> 00:18:22.815
maaaring bumisita anumang oras na gusto nila.

00:18:22.976 --> 00:18:24.696
Bakit sila dumating

00:18:24.896 --> 00:18:26.615
ngayon sa lahat ng panahon?

00:18:26.855 --> 00:18:27.815
Nakakasira ito

00:18:27.815 --> 00:18:29.456
buong plano ko.

00:18:29.855 --> 00:18:31.456
Makakahanap ka ba ng dahilan

00:18:31.615 --> 00:18:32.696
para paalisin sila?

00:18:34.656 --> 00:18:35.575
Hindi.

00:18:35.855 --> 00:18:36.696
Hindi.

00:18:36.855 --> 00:18:38.135
Kailan nagkaroon ng Liuguang Sect

00:18:38.135 --> 00:18:39.055
nirerespeto ba tayo?

00:18:39.256 --> 00:18:40.456
Nandito na sila...

00:18:41.696 --> 00:18:43.696
Teka, sinusubukan kong sabihin...

00:18:43.855 --> 00:18:44.896
Well...

00:18:45.095 --> 00:18:46.936
Ang mga alagad ng Liuguang Sect na ito

00:18:47.095 --> 00:18:48.256
ay mga kababata lamang.

00:18:48.335 --> 00:18:49.936
Para mabisita ko sila

00:18:50.095 --> 00:18:51.095
ay nasa ilalim ko.

00:18:51.256 --> 00:18:52.615
Ito ay isang kahihiyan.

00:18:52.775 --> 00:18:53.696
- Ito ay...
- Ama.

00:18:53.896 --> 00:18:54.496
Ama.

00:18:56.176 --> 00:18:57.055
Uminom ng tsaa.

00:18:57.055 --> 00:18:57.775
Sige.

00:18:58.055 --> 00:18:59.095
Mabuting bata.

00:19:00.496 --> 00:19:01.095
Xiao.

00:19:01.375 --> 00:19:02.496
Tara laro tayo.

00:19:02.496 --> 00:19:03.855
Sige, saglit lang.

00:19:03.896 --> 00:19:05.696
Jin Ling, umalis na tayo.

00:19:05.855 --> 00:19:06.815
Sa ilang sandali.

00:19:07.936 --> 00:19:08.736
Sige.

00:19:11.016 --> 00:19:11.815
Kalimutan mo na.

00:19:12.496 --> 00:19:14.016
Hayaan silang manatili sa ngayon.

00:19:14.095 --> 00:19:15.456
Lalo na yung babaeng yun

00:19:15.535 --> 00:19:17.176
named Kong Hou.

00:19:18.095 --> 00:19:19.855
Siya ay isang pino at maselan

00:19:19.855 --> 00:19:20.855
binibini, tama ba?

00:19:21.295 --> 00:19:22.615
Hindi natin siya papayagan

00:19:22.615 --> 00:19:23.775
pakiramdam na pinabayaan.

00:19:24.375 --> 00:19:25.095
Bukod,

00:19:25.295 --> 00:19:26.615
Isa akong respetadong senior.

00:19:26.775 --> 00:19:28.176
Tiyak na mararamdaman niya

00:19:28.176 --> 00:19:29.055
medyo uptight

00:19:30.256 --> 00:19:31.216
kung nakilala ko siya

00:19:31.216 --> 00:19:32.216
ngayon din.

00:19:34.055 --> 00:19:34.696
Xiao.

00:19:35.295 --> 00:19:36.216
Dapat kang magsumikap

00:19:36.295 --> 00:19:37.456
at ilagay ang iyong puso

00:19:37.535 --> 00:19:38.375
sa loob nito.

00:19:41.335 --> 00:19:42.656
Nagsumikap ka ngayon.

00:19:42.696 --> 00:19:43.696
Bumalik ka at magpahinga.

00:19:44.696 --> 00:19:45.535
Magpapaiwan ako.

00:19:45.656 --> 00:19:46.295
Sige.

00:19:49.055 --> 00:19:50.016
Jin Ling.

00:19:52.775 --> 00:19:53.736
manatili ka.

00:19:55.135 --> 00:19:55.936
Master.

00:19:55.936 --> 00:19:57.375
Nawalan ka ng malay.

00:19:57.416 --> 00:19:59.016
Ano ang pinagsasabi mo?

00:19:59.176 --> 00:20:00.815
Baka may bukol sa ulo ko,

00:20:00.936 --> 00:20:02.936
ngunit ang aking paghatol ay nananatiling matalas.

00:20:03.135 --> 00:20:04.855
Lalo na yung Huan Zong na yun.

00:20:05.055 --> 00:20:06.815
Siya ay malinaw na pambihira.

00:20:06.936 --> 00:20:07.815
Siya talaga

00:20:07.855 --> 00:20:09.696
isang matataas na disipulo ng Liuguang Sect.

00:20:10.815 --> 00:20:11.535
Jin Ling.

00:20:11.615 --> 00:20:12.615
Pag-isipan ito.

00:20:12.775 --> 00:20:14.656
Kung pakakasalan mo si Huan Zong

00:20:14.736 --> 00:20:16.535
at ikinasal si Xiao kay Kong Hou,

00:20:16.736 --> 00:20:18.095
tapos yung sekta namin

00:20:18.095 --> 00:20:19.095
maaaring makakuha ng kontrol

00:20:19.095 --> 00:20:20.736
sa parehong Yunhua

00:20:20.736 --> 00:20:22.295
at Liuguang Sects.

00:20:22.295 --> 00:20:23.335
pagtanggi ko.

00:20:23.335 --> 00:20:24.855
Ito ay para sa iyong ikabubuti.

00:20:38.855 --> 00:20:39.696
Naintindihan.

00:20:42.375 --> 00:20:43.256
Jin Ling.

00:20:43.656 --> 00:20:44.976
Palagi kitang tinatrato

00:20:44.976 --> 00:20:46.295
bilang sarili kong anak na babae.

00:20:46.736 --> 00:20:48.375
Masasaktan ba kita?

00:20:49.135 --> 00:20:49.976
Bukod,

00:20:49.976 --> 00:20:51.055
hindi ka ba tumingin

00:20:51.216 --> 00:20:52.656
malapit sa Huan Zong?

00:20:53.055 --> 00:20:55.375
Ang gwapo niya talaga.

00:20:56.016 --> 00:20:58.055
Gwapo din si Xiao.

00:20:59.375 --> 00:21:01.055
Seryoso ka ba?

00:21:01.416 --> 00:21:03.055
Paano niya maihahambing kay Huan Zong?

00:21:03.416 --> 00:21:04.976
Mas maganda si Huan Zong.

00:22:01.135 --> 00:22:02.855
Wala dito.

00:22:09.656 --> 00:22:10.815
May pagkain ka ba?

00:22:11.016 --> 00:22:11.855
Pagkain?

00:22:14.095 --> 00:22:15.256
ano?

00:22:15.615 --> 00:22:16.535
Siya ay mula sa

00:22:16.535 --> 00:22:18.135
isa sa Sampung Dakilang Sekta.

00:22:18.256 --> 00:22:20.135
A-At kailangan niyang kumain?

00:22:20.936 --> 00:22:23.456
Ano ang ginawa ng mga pangkaraniwan

00:22:23.615 --> 00:22:25.216
ng Yunhua Sect turuan siya?

00:22:25.736 --> 00:22:27.855
Master, ang problema niyan

00:22:27.936 --> 00:22:28.615
ang mga taong sekta natin

00:22:28.615 --> 00:22:29.855
lahat ay nag-aayuno.

00:22:29.855 --> 00:22:30.256
Oo.

00:22:30.256 --> 00:22:30.936
Walang pagkain.

00:22:30.936 --> 00:22:31.295
Oo.

00:22:31.295 --> 00:22:32.295
Walang nagluluto.

00:22:32.295 --> 00:22:33.375
Oo.

00:22:33.375 --> 00:22:33.855
Siya...

00:22:35.535 --> 00:22:36.016
Well...

00:22:36.016 --> 00:22:36.855
Ikaw...

00:22:38.815 --> 00:22:39.696
Ipasa ang order.

00:22:40.896 --> 00:22:42.535
Sabihin sa lahat ng aming mga alagad.

00:22:42.575 --> 00:22:43.976
Kung sino man ang marunong magprito,

00:22:44.055 --> 00:22:45.575
pakuluan, pinirito, o nilaga ang anumang bagay

00:22:45.936 --> 00:22:47.976
dapat magtipon sa kusina.

00:22:48.095 --> 00:22:50.176
Gagantimpalaan ko sila ng maganda.

00:22:50.575 --> 00:22:51.375
- Magtipon.
- Naghihintay ang mga gantimpala.

00:22:51.416 --> 00:22:52.216
Magtipon.

00:22:52.256 --> 00:22:53.295
- Naghihintay ang mga gantimpala.
- Naghihintay ang mga gantimpala.

00:22:53.416 --> 00:22:53.936
Magtipon...

00:22:54.095 --> 00:22:56.216
Umalis ka na.

00:23:22.176 --> 00:23:23.055
Hindi masama.

00:23:23.375 --> 00:23:24.176
Pumili

00:23:24.575 --> 00:23:26.335
ang pinakamasarap na pagkain

00:23:26.375 --> 00:23:28.295
para kay Lady Kong Hou at sabihin sa kanya

00:23:28.335 --> 00:23:29.295
na ginawa mo ang mga iyon.

00:23:29.416 --> 00:23:30.256
Master.

00:23:30.256 --> 00:23:31.416
Nakonsensya ako

00:23:31.416 --> 00:23:32.736
tungkol sa pagkuha ng kredito.

00:23:32.736 --> 00:23:34.176
Ito ay isang diskarte.

00:23:34.335 --> 00:23:35.456
Gaya nga ng kasabihan,

00:23:35.456 --> 00:23:37.575
"Upang makuha ang puso ng isang babae,

00:23:37.575 --> 00:23:38.815
alam mo,

00:23:38.976 --> 00:23:41.055
kailangan mo munang manalo sa tiyan niya."

00:23:41.256 --> 00:23:42.416
Ang diskarte ko

00:23:42.575 --> 00:23:43.456
gagana.

00:23:47.736 --> 00:23:49.375
Upang mabigyan ng pabor si Kong Hou,

00:23:49.535 --> 00:23:50.775
Master Shuang Qing

00:23:50.775 --> 00:23:52.855
ay sumusubok nang labis.

00:23:53.375 --> 00:23:54.575
Isang lider ng sekta

00:23:54.736 --> 00:23:56.416
ay mapagkamalan ng isang maitim na magsasaka

00:23:56.416 --> 00:23:57.976
para sa isang magiliw na kakilala.

00:23:58.176 --> 00:23:59.335
Masyado siyang tanga para makamit

00:23:59.335 --> 00:24:00.055
kahit ano.

00:24:01.055 --> 00:24:01.896
Young Master.

00:24:02.295 --> 00:24:03.135
Tayo na lang

00:24:03.135 --> 00:24:04.216
suriin ang mga bagay-bagay

00:24:04.216 --> 00:24:05.176
at gumawa ng plano

00:24:05.335 --> 00:24:06.295
pagkatapos ng mga miyembro ng sekta namin

00:24:06.295 --> 00:24:07.135
dumating.

00:24:07.256 --> 00:24:08.775
Kakaiba ang mga bulaklak na iyon.

00:24:09.295 --> 00:24:10.456
Mga miyembro ng sekta namin

00:24:10.615 --> 00:24:12.016
baka hindi alam ang gagawin.

00:24:54.095 --> 00:24:55.055
Lady Kong Hou.

00:25:00.216 --> 00:25:01.696
(Anong nangyayari dito?)

00:25:01.896 --> 00:25:03.416
(Ang mga taong ito ba ay parang pasikat)

00:25:03.416 --> 00:25:04.736
(bilang Ling Bo?)

00:25:06.135 --> 00:25:07.656
(Basta. Kain muna tayo.)

00:25:09.216 --> 00:25:10.736
Lady Kong Hou, narito.

00:25:14.055 --> 00:25:15.456
Inihanda mo ba ang lahat ng ito?

00:25:15.575 --> 00:25:16.416
hindi ako sigurado

00:25:16.416 --> 00:25:17.496
kung gusto mo ang mga ito.

00:25:33.656 --> 00:25:34.496
Kumuha ng hipon.

00:25:36.135 --> 00:25:37.456
Halika, maghukay ka.

00:25:37.456 --> 00:25:38.855
nagugutom na ako. Huwag mo akong pansinin.

00:25:38.855 --> 00:25:39.775
Sige.

00:25:40.335 --> 00:25:42.256
Ang easy-going mo talaga.

00:25:42.535 --> 00:25:43.736
Sa aming sekta,

00:25:43.936 --> 00:25:44.736
ang dining hall

00:25:44.736 --> 00:25:46.535
nagiging masikip sa oras ng pagkain.

00:25:46.535 --> 00:25:47.176
Dapat kang magmadali

00:25:47.176 --> 00:25:47.976
para makakuha ng pagkain.

00:25:47.976 --> 00:25:49.256
Nagsanay ako para dito.

00:25:51.095 --> 00:25:51.815
Lady Kong Hou,

00:25:52.335 --> 00:25:54.216
Balita ko may pinakamagandang tanawin ang sekta mo

00:25:54.216 --> 00:25:55.456
sa Lingyou Realm.

00:25:55.775 --> 00:25:57.815
Gusto kong bumisita minsan.

00:25:57.976 --> 00:25:58.615
Gusto mo

00:25:58.615 --> 00:26:00.016
maging handa sa

00:26:00.016 --> 00:26:01.216
gabayan mo ako noon?

00:26:01.936 --> 00:26:02.936
Walang problema.

00:26:02.936 --> 00:26:04.295
Kukunin ko ang aking mga senior disciples

00:26:04.295 --> 00:26:05.256
ipakita sa iyo sa paligid.

00:26:05.736 --> 00:26:06.615
Sige.

00:26:07.295 --> 00:26:08.256
Tama, Young Master?

00:26:08.456 --> 00:26:09.656
Yun din ang iniisip ko.

00:26:13.656 --> 00:26:14.496
Nagsasaya sila

00:26:14.496 --> 00:26:15.575
sa ganitong oras sa gabi.

00:26:15.656 --> 00:26:17.216
Napakaraming kandila.

00:26:17.216 --> 00:26:18.535
Napakaromantiko.

00:26:18.775 --> 00:26:19.575
Young Master.

00:26:20.016 --> 00:26:20.855
Sa tingin mo ba

00:26:21.055 --> 00:26:22.736
Baka magustuhan ni Zhou Xiao

00:26:22.936 --> 00:26:24.216
Lady Kong Hou?

00:26:25.456 --> 00:26:26.535
Sa aking palagay,

00:26:26.815 --> 00:26:27.656
ang Yuanji Sect

00:26:27.815 --> 00:26:29.496
ay hindi isa sa Sampung Dakilang Sekta,

00:26:29.656 --> 00:26:30.936
ngunit ang paglilinang ni Zhou Xiao

00:26:31.095 --> 00:26:33.295
tugma nang maayos

00:26:33.496 --> 00:26:35.055
kasama si Kong Hou.

00:26:35.535 --> 00:26:36.615
Ano sa tingin mo?

00:26:37.335 --> 00:26:38.375
Nakuha lahat?

00:26:38.615 --> 00:26:39.496
Sumakay ka na.

00:26:41.535 --> 00:26:42.335
Sige.

00:26:52.736 --> 00:26:53.496
Huan Zong.

00:26:53.696 --> 00:26:55.335
Gising ka pa ba sa ganitong oras?

00:26:57.135 --> 00:26:58.135
Nagugutom ka rin ba?

00:26:58.135 --> 00:26:59.095
Gusto mo ng pagkain?

00:26:59.135 --> 00:27:01.095
Nakakamangha ang scallion oil noodles.

00:27:06.656 --> 00:27:09.095
Oh tama, nag-aayuno ka.

00:27:11.575 --> 00:27:12.615
Sayang naman.

00:27:12.775 --> 00:27:13.456
Huan Zong,

00:27:13.456 --> 00:27:14.976
bakit hindi ka bumalik sa pahinga?

00:27:14.976 --> 00:27:15.775
ipapadala kita

00:27:15.775 --> 00:27:17.055
ilang mga espirituwal na bunga.

00:27:17.775 --> 00:27:19.375
Kung tama ang pagkakaalala ko,

00:27:19.575 --> 00:27:21.775
nag-aayuno ka rin.

00:27:23.896 --> 00:27:25.095
Ang aming Yuanji Sect

00:27:25.095 --> 00:27:26.055
ay hindi kasing higpit

00:27:26.055 --> 00:27:26.855
ang Sekta ng Liuguang.

00:27:26.976 --> 00:27:27.976
May pagkain kami

00:27:28.375 --> 00:27:30.016
paminsan-minsan.

00:27:31.295 --> 00:27:32.216
ayos lang.

00:27:32.615 --> 00:27:34.775
Masaya ang buwan kasama kayong dalawa

00:27:35.055 --> 00:27:36.375
ay medyo kaaya-aya.

00:27:36.855 --> 00:27:38.055
Kung ganoon,

00:27:38.055 --> 00:27:39.496
sabay tayo mag usap.

00:27:42.656 --> 00:27:45.055
Sige.

00:28:03.335 --> 00:28:04.216
Zhou.

00:28:06.936 --> 00:28:08.216
Kakaiba,

00:28:08.775 --> 00:28:10.335
may mga dark cultivator

00:28:10.456 --> 00:28:12.295
malapit sa iyong Yuanji Sect.

00:28:16.295 --> 00:28:18.135
Masyadong matapang ang mga dark cultivator na iyon.

00:28:18.896 --> 00:28:19.815
narinig ko

00:28:19.815 --> 00:28:21.496
nagdulot din sila ng gulo sa Qiu City.

00:28:21.736 --> 00:28:22.896
hindi ko alam

00:28:22.976 --> 00:28:24.256
pupunta sila sa Sanshu City.

00:28:27.855 --> 00:28:28.976
Sa kasamaang palad,

00:28:30.095 --> 00:28:31.176
natakot sila

00:28:31.176 --> 00:28:32.055
Lady Kong Hou.

00:28:32.736 --> 00:28:33.896
ayos lang.

00:28:33.896 --> 00:28:34.696
hindi ba

00:28:34.696 --> 00:28:35.696
hakbang pasulong sa oras

00:28:35.696 --> 00:28:36.896
para protektahan ako?

00:28:37.016 --> 00:28:37.496
Bukod,

00:28:37.496 --> 00:28:38.815
Nakilala ko lang si Lady Jin Ling

00:28:38.855 --> 00:28:40.456
at nagkaroon ng pagkakataong matuto mula sa kanya

00:28:40.456 --> 00:28:41.815
dahil sa pangyayari.

00:28:42.016 --> 00:28:42.896
tama ka.

00:28:43.095 --> 00:28:44.375
Maaaring totoo iyon.

00:28:45.936 --> 00:28:47.656
Ngunit kailan ka humingi ng patnubay sa kanya?

00:28:47.896 --> 00:28:48.615
ako...

00:28:49.176 --> 00:28:50.176
Well...

00:28:50.375 --> 00:28:52.135
Pupunta ako sa kanya,

00:28:52.135 --> 00:28:53.775
ngunit ako ay nagugutom

00:28:53.775 --> 00:28:55.295
at hindi nagkaroon ng pagkakataon.

00:28:55.295 --> 00:28:56.256
pupunta ako ngayon.

00:29:02.335 --> 00:29:03.135
Huli na.

00:29:06.216 --> 00:29:06.976
Oo.

00:29:07.055 --> 00:29:08.775
Gabi na pala.

00:29:08.976 --> 00:29:10.535
ginulo mo ako.

00:29:10.535 --> 00:29:11.815
Mauuna na ako bukas.

00:29:16.016 --> 00:29:16.896
ayos lang yan.

00:29:28.656 --> 00:29:29.496
Gusto mo pa?

00:29:30.535 --> 00:29:31.335
Sige na.

00:30:11.535 --> 00:30:12.976
Tigre na bumababa sa bundok.

00:30:23.375 --> 00:30:24.016
Young Master,

00:30:24.896 --> 00:30:26.416
Nag-scout ako sa paligid

00:30:26.615 --> 00:30:27.896
at walang nakitang kakaiba.

00:30:28.095 --> 00:30:28.855
Ngunit isang patyo

00:30:28.855 --> 00:30:29.775
sa likod

00:30:29.775 --> 00:30:30.976
may mahigpit na seguridad.

00:30:31.375 --> 00:30:33.176
Humanap ng paraan para makapasok.

00:30:33.775 --> 00:30:34.496
Naintindihan.

00:30:41.456 --> 00:30:42.375
Ayon sa plano,

00:30:42.696 --> 00:30:43.416
Gagastos si Xiao

00:30:44.016 --> 00:30:46.176
ang araw kasama si Kong Hou,

00:30:46.335 --> 00:30:49.696
habang si Ling ay nananatili sa tabi ni Huan Zong.

00:30:50.416 --> 00:30:51.696
Ang tatay mo

00:30:51.775 --> 00:30:52.936
ay isang henyo.

00:30:53.736 --> 00:30:54.575
Henyo.

00:30:54.696 --> 00:30:55.775
Henyo.

00:30:56.456 --> 00:30:57.815
Henyo.

00:31:00.496 --> 00:31:01.216
Nagplano ako

00:31:01.216 --> 00:31:02.295
para ipakita sayo

00:31:03.095 --> 00:31:03.855
at lahat

00:31:04.016 --> 00:31:05.256
ang tanawin ng aming sekta

00:31:05.256 --> 00:31:06.335
sa mga lumilipad na bundok.

00:31:06.535 --> 00:31:07.375
Gayunpaman...

00:31:07.375 --> 00:31:08.016
Mga nakatatanda.

00:31:08.016 --> 00:31:08.775
ayos lang.

00:31:08.775 --> 00:31:09.936
Naglalakad-lakad ng ganito

00:31:09.936 --> 00:31:10.775
ay maganda rin.

00:31:10.775 --> 00:31:11.456
talaga?

00:31:11.575 --> 00:31:12.095
Napakahusay.

00:31:12.375 --> 00:31:13.016
mamaya,

00:31:13.016 --> 00:31:14.216
ipapakita ko sayo

00:31:14.216 --> 00:31:15.375
ang aming Eight Trigrams Formation.

00:31:15.375 --> 00:31:16.176
At ang aming mga minahan ay

00:31:16.256 --> 00:31:17.456
mas mahaba kaysa sa Qingfeng Sect.

00:31:17.736 --> 00:31:19.575
Mga hot spring, Bishui Pavilion.

00:31:19.775 --> 00:31:21.055
Ang aming mga hot spring

00:31:21.135 --> 00:31:22.055
ay katangi-tangi.

00:31:22.095 --> 00:31:22.696
Doon.

00:31:22.855 --> 00:31:23.775
Mga hot spring.

00:31:23.976 --> 00:31:24.976
I bet marunong ka magluto

00:31:24.976 --> 00:31:26.095
maraming itlog nang sabay-sabay.

00:31:28.216 --> 00:31:29.896
Ang hot spring boiled egg
ay isang signature dish

00:31:29.896 --> 00:31:30.496
ng aming sekta.

00:31:31.896 --> 00:31:32.456
Sa susunod,

00:31:32.456 --> 00:31:33.855
Kapag binisita mo ang Yunhua Sect,

00:31:33.855 --> 00:31:34.456
subukan natin

00:31:34.456 --> 00:31:35.696
ang aming signature beef noodles.

00:31:35.696 --> 00:31:36.496
Yong City iyon

00:31:36.496 --> 00:31:37.216
espesyalidad na ulam.

00:31:37.335 --> 00:31:38.216
Sige.

00:31:46.936 --> 00:31:47.896
Deal.

00:31:48.736 --> 00:31:50.055
Deal.

00:31:54.456 --> 00:31:55.216
Halika dito.

00:31:58.295 --> 00:31:59.575
Bumibisita ka ba sa hot spring?

00:31:59.575 --> 00:32:00.375
Oo.

00:32:00.535 --> 00:32:01.256
alam mo ba

00:32:01.256 --> 00:32:02.615
kailangan ng dalawang tao para...?

00:32:02.696 --> 00:32:03.416
Huan Zong,

00:32:03.936 --> 00:32:05.456
kung hindi ka interesado,

00:32:05.615 --> 00:32:06.855
Maaaring ipakita sa iyo ni Jin Ling

00:32:06.936 --> 00:32:08.256
ang Eight Trigrams Formation.

00:32:08.456 --> 00:32:09.016
Jin Ling.

00:32:09.416 --> 00:32:10.176
Hindi na kailangan.

00:32:10.656 --> 00:32:11.656
Gusto ko ang mga hot spring.

00:32:11.936 --> 00:32:12.815
Tara na.

00:32:12.936 --> 00:32:13.976
Huan Zong,

00:32:14.135 --> 00:32:15.016
huwag mong pilitin ang sarili mo.

00:32:15.055 --> 00:32:15.896
hindi ko ginawa.

00:32:16.055 --> 00:32:17.496
Tapos sabay na tayo.

00:32:18.055 --> 00:32:18.936
Magkasama.

00:32:20.855 --> 00:32:21.976
Anong bulaklak yan?

00:32:22.016 --> 00:32:23.176
Sobrang ganda.

00:32:28.656 --> 00:32:29.416
Xiao.

00:32:29.615 --> 00:32:30.176
Mag-ingat ka...

00:32:37.855 --> 00:32:39.216
ng mga tinik.

00:32:55.896 --> 00:32:56.736
Huan Zong.

00:32:57.055 --> 00:32:58.855
Masama pa rin ang loob ko dito.

00:32:58.855 --> 00:33:00.016
Kung tutuusin, nasaktan ka

00:33:00.016 --> 00:33:01.016
sinusubukan akong protektahan.

00:33:01.216 --> 00:33:02.016
tanong ko lang

00:33:02.016 --> 00:33:03.295
ang mga manggagamot.

00:33:03.295 --> 00:33:04.095
Sabi nila

00:33:04.176 --> 00:33:05.656
maaari kang kumamot sa paligid

00:33:05.656 --> 00:33:06.335
ang mga sugat

00:33:06.335 --> 00:33:07.295
basta

00:33:07.295 --> 00:33:08.496
hindi mo sila sinisira.

00:33:09.615 --> 00:33:10.295
Nakuha ko.

00:33:11.736 --> 00:33:13.855
Kung hindi mo sila maabot,

00:33:13.855 --> 00:33:14.896
matutulungan kita.

00:33:14.896 --> 00:33:15.936
Hindi na kailangan.

00:33:16.176 --> 00:33:17.016
Matulog ka na.

00:33:17.016 --> 00:33:18.775
Paano ako makakatulog ngayon?

00:33:18.775 --> 00:33:20.055
Kung tutuusin, nasaktan ka

00:33:20.055 --> 00:33:21.416
pinoprotektahan ako.

00:33:22.456 --> 00:33:23.095
ayos lang.

00:33:24.775 --> 00:33:26.256
Huwag kang mahiya.

00:33:26.456 --> 00:33:27.815
Hayaan mong tulungan kita.

00:33:28.016 --> 00:33:29.535
Magaling ako dito.

00:33:29.696 --> 00:33:30.896
Nung mga junior disciples ko

00:33:30.896 --> 00:33:31.696
nagkaroon ng mga pantal,

00:33:31.736 --> 00:33:32.815
Tinulungan ko sila.

00:33:33.016 --> 00:33:34.256
Napakasarap sa pakiramdam.

00:33:34.335 --> 00:33:35.615
Subukan ito at makikita mo.

00:33:35.615 --> 00:33:36.375
Bumalik ka.

00:33:40.176 --> 00:33:41.696
Magsaya kasama si Zhou Xiao.

00:33:43.016 --> 00:33:44.615
Hindi ka ba magpapakulo ng ilang itlog nang sabay?

00:33:44.815 --> 00:33:46.896
Magagawa natin iyon anumang oras.

00:33:46.896 --> 00:33:47.656
Napagkasunduan naming gawin ito

00:33:47.656 --> 00:33:48.615
bukas.

00:33:49.896 --> 00:33:51.016
Bukas?

00:33:51.416 --> 00:33:52.016
Oo.

00:33:52.335 --> 00:33:53.775
Huwag mo akong itaboy.

00:33:53.815 --> 00:33:55.095
Hayaan mong kamot ako sa likod mo.

00:33:55.256 --> 00:33:55.855
Lumabas ka.

00:34:07.575 --> 00:34:08.336
Mas maganda ang pakiramdam?

00:34:08.735 --> 00:34:09.336
Well?

00:34:09.896 --> 00:34:11.296
Halika, manatili ka.

00:34:11.655 --> 00:34:13.496
Ito ay medikal na paggamot.

00:34:13.575 --> 00:34:14.615
Bakit ka natatakot?

00:34:14.735 --> 00:34:16.336
Ito ay yelo.

00:34:16.535 --> 00:34:18.336
Nakakatulong ito na mabawasan ang pamamaga.

00:34:18.376 --> 00:34:19.615
Wag mong sabihin sakin

00:34:19.776 --> 00:34:21.496
nahihiya ka pa ba ngayon?

00:34:23.695 --> 00:34:24.735
Bukod,

00:34:24.735 --> 00:34:27.055
diba sabi mo

00:34:27.255 --> 00:34:29.255
kasarian ang katabi

00:34:29.336 --> 00:34:31.135
nagliligtas ng buhay?

00:34:33.255 --> 00:34:34.496
Sa mga ganitong sitwasyon,

00:34:35.376 --> 00:34:36.376
ito ay katanggap-tanggap.

00:34:36.816 --> 00:34:38.376
Ngunit hindi mo dapat karaniwang gawin iyon.

00:34:38.936 --> 00:34:40.175
Anong masama dun?

00:34:40.175 --> 00:34:41.215
Halimbawa,

00:34:41.336 --> 00:34:42.575
pwede tayong maging close sa isa't isa

00:34:42.695 --> 00:34:44.055
kasi magkaibigan tayo.

00:34:44.296 --> 00:34:45.615
Ngunit hindi mo kaibigan si Zhou Xiao.

00:34:45.695 --> 00:34:46.655
Senior Zhou Xiao

00:34:46.655 --> 00:34:47.655
ay kaibigan ko rin.

00:34:48.016 --> 00:34:48.535
kailan ka

00:34:48.535 --> 00:34:49.735
maging magkaibigan?

00:34:49.896 --> 00:34:51.016
Dapat tayong mag-ingat

00:34:51.016 --> 00:34:52.135
ng bawat isa.

00:34:52.255 --> 00:34:53.976
Magkaibigan kaming lahat.

00:34:55.456 --> 00:34:56.735
Tapos ano ako?

00:34:57.296 --> 00:34:59.535
Magkaibigan din kami.

00:35:00.296 --> 00:35:01.456
kaibigan mo rin ako?

00:35:09.175 --> 00:35:11.376
Ngunit hayaan mong sabihin ko sa iyo ang isang sikreto.

00:35:11.376 --> 00:35:12.175
ikaw ay

00:35:12.175 --> 00:35:13.816
iba sa Senior Zhou Xiao.

00:35:13.896 --> 00:35:16.055
Ikaw ay napaka, napakahalaga

00:35:16.055 --> 00:35:17.175
sa akin bilang kaibigan.

00:35:19.496 --> 00:35:22.416
"Napaka, napakahalaga."

00:35:22.655 --> 00:35:23.575
Gaano kahalaga ang eksaktong?

00:35:24.376 --> 00:35:25.496
Kung kailangan kitang i-rank

00:35:25.496 --> 00:35:26.695
sa iyong kahalagahan,

00:35:26.695 --> 00:35:27.535
Senior Zhou Xiao

00:35:27.535 --> 00:35:28.695
ay nasa ikasampung puwesto,

00:35:28.695 --> 00:35:30.456
habang ikaw ay pangalawa.

00:35:33.416 --> 00:35:34.496
So sino ang mauuna?

00:35:35.055 --> 00:35:35.695
Unang lugar?

00:35:36.296 --> 00:35:38.095
Si Senior Ling Hui, siyempre.

00:35:38.135 --> 00:35:38.776
Bagama't siya ay

00:35:38.776 --> 00:35:40.016
Ang disipulo ni Master Pei Huai,

00:35:40.095 --> 00:35:40.856
lumaki kami

00:35:40.856 --> 00:35:42.055
magkasama.

00:35:42.135 --> 00:35:44.215
At ipinakita niya sa akin
kung paano gumawa ng mga spirit stone.

00:35:51.695 --> 00:35:52.936
Ang pangalawang lugar ay katanggap-tanggap.

00:35:54.496 --> 00:35:55.255
Huan Zong,

00:35:55.255 --> 00:35:56.936
pakialam mo sa rankings?

00:35:56.936 --> 00:35:58.296
Anong bata.

00:35:58.376 --> 00:35:59.135
Napakaganda.

00:35:59.735 --> 00:36:00.496
Mas gumaan ang pakiramdam?

00:36:02.496 --> 00:36:03.695
Hindi.

00:36:06.215 --> 00:36:08.016
Clueless ka.

00:36:08.336 --> 00:36:09.695
Mga alagad ng Liuguang Sect

00:36:09.695 --> 00:36:10.575
bumisita.

00:36:12.175 --> 00:36:13.655
Kung nagmamadali tayong makipagkita sa kanila

00:36:13.655 --> 00:36:14.255
kaagad,

00:36:15.055 --> 00:36:15.976
gagawin namin

00:36:15.976 --> 00:36:17.255
mawala ang ating katayuan.

00:36:19.095 --> 00:36:20.135
Pero

00:36:20.776 --> 00:36:22.055
nasugatan siya ngayon.

00:36:22.215 --> 00:36:23.376
Bilang pinuno ng sekta,

00:36:23.376 --> 00:36:24.416
pupuntahan ko

00:36:24.655 --> 00:36:25.416
tingnan mo siya.

00:36:25.456 --> 00:36:27.936
Ipinapakita nito ang mga asal ng isang pangunahing sekta.

00:36:28.336 --> 00:36:30.296
Kailangang magpahinga ngayon ni Huan Zong.

00:36:30.575 --> 00:36:31.575
Hindi siya pwedeng makialam

00:36:31.575 --> 00:36:33.376
iyong mga pakikipag-ugnayan kay Kong Hou.

00:36:33.615 --> 00:36:34.376
sa tingin ko

00:36:35.095 --> 00:36:37.135
nasugatan siya sa perpektong oras.

00:36:37.535 --> 00:36:38.215
Mas gumaan ang pakiramdam?

00:36:38.376 --> 00:36:39.776
Oo.

00:36:40.376 --> 00:36:41.175
Oo.

00:36:42.456 --> 00:36:43.135
Magsabi ka.

00:36:43.416 --> 00:36:44.575
Paano ko malalaman

00:36:44.615 --> 00:36:45.655
kung maayos ang pressure?

00:36:47.976 --> 00:36:49.695
Master, sila...

00:36:56.575 --> 00:36:57.255
Xiao.

00:36:57.575 --> 00:36:59.016
Ano sa tingin mo

00:36:59.095 --> 00:37:00.135
tungkol sa nangyari?

00:37:00.535 --> 00:37:01.296
Guro,

00:37:01.816 --> 00:37:02.735
Wala akong lakas ng loob na isipin

00:37:03.095 --> 00:37:04.055
anong nangyari.

00:37:04.095 --> 00:37:05.416
Hindi ka maglakas-loob na isipin ito?

00:37:06.135 --> 00:37:08.376
Walang kwenta.

00:37:08.376 --> 00:37:09.535
Ouch.

00:37:09.535 --> 00:37:11.776
Bakit hindi mo magawang umapela sa kanya?

00:37:11.856 --> 00:37:13.135
Ang alagad ng Liuguang Sect na iyon

00:37:13.135 --> 00:37:14.575
nagawang gayumahin

00:37:14.575 --> 00:37:15.456
itong ginang.

00:37:15.496 --> 00:37:16.016
meron

00:37:16.016 --> 00:37:17.135
isang bagay sa pagitan nila.

00:37:17.376 --> 00:37:18.416
Sumuko na lang tayo.

00:37:18.416 --> 00:37:19.215
Oo.

00:37:20.296 --> 00:37:21.255
sumuko na?

00:37:21.535 --> 00:37:22.695
Blockhead ka.

00:37:22.816 --> 00:37:23.735
Hindi kami sumusuko.

00:37:23.735 --> 00:37:24.896
Paano tayo makakaalis ngayon?

00:37:26.936 --> 00:37:27.735
Makinig ng mabuti.

00:37:28.336 --> 00:37:30.095
Hayaan akong suriin ito para sa iyo.

00:37:32.215 --> 00:37:34.255
Sino ang nagligtas kay Kong Hou?

00:37:34.255 --> 00:37:34.896
Ginawa ni Huan Zong.

00:37:35.016 --> 00:37:36.856
Oo, iniligtas ni Huan Zong si Kong Hou

00:37:36.856 --> 00:37:38.896
at nasugatan sa proseso.

00:37:39.255 --> 00:37:41.016
Natural, aalagaan siya nito.

00:37:41.215 --> 00:37:43.175
Ang ganitong pakikipag-ugnayan

00:37:44.095 --> 00:37:45.336
lumilikha ng isang bagay.

00:37:47.055 --> 00:37:47.776
Ngayon naiintindihan ko na.

00:37:47.896 --> 00:37:49.215
Hindi, ayaw mo.

00:37:49.296 --> 00:37:50.296
Ano ang nakuha mo?

00:37:50.336 --> 00:37:51.215
hindi ko nakuha.

00:37:51.416 --> 00:37:52.255
Makinig ka.

00:37:52.255 --> 00:37:53.535
naniniwala ako

00:37:53.976 --> 00:37:55.816
na Kong Hou

00:37:56.336 --> 00:37:57.816
ay sa isang tao

00:37:58.055 --> 00:38:00.215
na nagpaparamdam sa kanya ng katiwasayan

00:38:00.215 --> 00:38:02.255
pa rin nagbubunyag

00:38:02.456 --> 00:38:04.336
kanyang mahina

00:38:04.936 --> 00:38:06.016
gilid.

00:38:09.095 --> 00:38:10.055
Master.

00:38:10.976 --> 00:38:12.135
hindi ba

00:38:12.135 --> 00:38:14.175
pakasalan ang iyong dating asawa tungkol sa

00:38:14.255 --> 00:38:15.175
dalawang siglo na ang nakalipas?

00:38:15.175 --> 00:38:16.416
Dalawa at kalahating siglo.

00:38:16.496 --> 00:38:18.095
Ganun sana

00:38:18.095 --> 00:38:19.456
matagal na ang nakalipas

00:38:19.456 --> 00:38:20.055
para sa mga mortal.

00:38:20.055 --> 00:38:21.215
Mga henerasyon na ang nakalipas.

00:38:21.336 --> 00:38:24.296
Sigurado ka bang gumagana pa rin ang iyong mga pamamaraan?

00:38:28.255 --> 00:38:29.896
Pag-isipan ito.

00:38:30.336 --> 00:38:32.535
Niligtas mo si Kong Hou minsan.

00:38:32.535 --> 00:38:34.215
Magpaparamdam siya

00:38:34.215 --> 00:38:36.296
secure sa paligid mo.

00:38:36.535 --> 00:38:37.255
ngayon...

00:38:43.416 --> 00:38:45.055
Kailangan mong masugatan.

00:38:45.296 --> 00:38:46.175
Master.

00:38:46.735 --> 00:38:47.695
Masakit.

00:38:50.535 --> 00:38:52.095
Martial contest ba ito?

00:39:01.776 --> 00:39:03.816
- Guro.
- Guro.

00:39:06.735 --> 00:39:08.776
Sorry late ako.

00:39:09.456 --> 00:39:10.296
Ito dapat

00:39:10.336 --> 00:39:11.095
ang kilala

00:39:11.095 --> 00:39:12.816
Lady Kong Hou ng Yunhua Sect?

00:39:12.896 --> 00:39:14.496
Ikaw dapat si Master Shuang Qing?

00:39:14.776 --> 00:39:15.575
ako yun.

00:39:16.135 --> 00:39:18.055
Nagbibigay galang ako kay Master Shuang Qing.

00:39:18.816 --> 00:39:21.095
Magandang babae. Kaya magalang.

00:39:22.535 --> 00:39:23.535
Ang aming Yuanji Sect

00:39:23.535 --> 00:39:25.175
nagdaraos ng taunang martial contests.

00:39:25.296 --> 00:39:26.976
Perfect timing para sa iyo

00:39:27.055 --> 00:39:28.416
upang obserbahan.

00:39:28.655 --> 00:39:29.615
Sige.

00:39:29.655 --> 00:39:31.175
Gawin ang iyong sarili sa bahay

00:39:31.215 --> 00:39:32.936
sa Yuanji Sect.

00:39:39.055 --> 00:39:40.416
Maghanda para sa paligsahan.

00:39:41.095 --> 00:39:42.095
- Sige.
- Go for it.

00:39:42.416 --> 00:39:43.416
Nakuha mo ito.

00:39:43.496 --> 00:39:44.215
Go for it.

00:39:44.416 --> 00:39:45.055
Go!

00:39:45.055 --> 00:39:45.655
Go for it!

00:39:47.615 --> 00:39:48.456
Go for it!

00:39:49.896 --> 00:39:50.655
Halika na!

00:39:50.896 --> 00:39:51.896
Halika na!

