♪She's blazes uncontrolled♪

00:41:41.350 --> 00:41:43.631
♪Isang sakit ng kaluluwa♪

00:41:43.631 --> 00:41:46.633
♪Malamig na gabi ang sumasakit♪

00:41:46.793 --> 00:41:49.225
♪Kaya lang♪

00:41:49.475 --> 00:41:55.774
♪Lahat ng pagsisikap ay walang kapalit♪

00:41:57.781 --> 00:42:00.425
♪Paglabag sa makamundong pagnanasa♪

00:42:00.933 --> 00:42:03.597
